{"t": 1794104891.5406833, "kind": "call", "tool": "atlassian_jira_add_comment", "args": {"body": "Implemented the agreed fix in `checkout.promo.normalize_code`.\n\n- Normalisation now strips surrounding whitespace, removes inner whitespace, and upper-cases the code before lookup (e.g. `' autumn24 '` -> `AUTUMN24`).\n- Verified against representative inputs, including codes with surrounding and inner spaces.\n\nThis addresses Sentry issue CHECKOUT-WEB-7Q (`PromoNotFound: code ' autumn24 ' does not exist`, ~2,940 events on Android 15 / app 8.2).", "issue_key": "PAY-618"}, "ok": true}
